+@deftypevr {C Target Hook} bool TARGET_CXX_SYSTEM_HEADERS_IMPLICIT_EXTERN_C
+When true, C++ declarations in non-C++-aware system headers have C linkage.
+This supports legacy SDKs whose C headers do not provide extern C guards.
+C++-aware include directories retain their normal C++ linkage.
+@end deftypevr
 
